1
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:14,750
[Connecting to You]

2
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,050
Against the car.

3
00:01:21,539 --> 00:01:22,350
Quit squirming.

4
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,350
You too.

5
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:25,210
Why do you keep squirming?

6
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:26,810
Are you two worms or what?

7
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,860
Dawei.

8
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:31,910
Senior.

9
00:01:31,930 --> 00:01:32,920
Why are you here?

10
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,490
Someone just reported that

11
00:01:35,490 --> 00:01:37,000
2 young people were doing drugs in a car.

12
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,170
I searched all the way here.

13
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:42,220
I found the paraphernalia and residue

14
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:43,050
in the car.

15
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,110
Okay.

16
00:01:44,130 --> 00:01:45,470
Let's take one each.

17
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:46,900
What do you mean?

18
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,720
This falls under
my precinct's jurisdiction.

19
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,490
What do you mean? I told you last time.

20
00:01:50,490 --> 00:01:51,690
Let's earn performance points together.

21
00:01:51,690 --> 00:01:52,780
Okay, let's go.

22
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:54,680
Wait a minute.

23
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,180
Jian.

24
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,600
Who are you calling Jian?

25
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,800
Did you guys plan this?

26
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:06,410
I'll take these 2 people

27
00:02:06,410 --> 00:02:08,620
and all the evidence back to the station.

28
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,080
There's nothing to split.

29
00:02:10,850 --> 00:02:12,050
What's your problem?

30
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:14,490
You don't listen to your senior anymore?

31
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,760
Let me tell you this.

32
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:18,500
You'll be crushed
by performance pressure one day.

33
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:19,960
I'll ask you one more time.

34
00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:21,540
Are you going to help or not?

35
00:02:24,170 --> 00:02:25,570
You're not going to help?

36
00:02:25,829 --> 00:02:27,690
Next time we cross paths on a case,

37
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:29,210
I'll ruin you.

38
00:02:40,329 --> 00:02:41,570
[The 6th Thread]

39
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:44,010
[Misattribution of Arousal] [Love
between Reality and Illusion in Crisis]

40
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,079
You're back.

41
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,320
I brought your bag in.

42
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:58,270
You don't even cook.

43
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,160
Why did you buy so much stuff?

44
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:03,950
Someone sent them to me.

45
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,650
Your family?

46
00:03:20,350 --> 00:03:21,470
And these.

47
00:03:28,050 --> 00:03:30,160
[Redeem for One Set Meal]

48
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:31,079
For you.

49
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,510
What are these?

50
00:03:36,670 --> 00:03:38,230
I was going to go with my boyfriend,

51
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,600
but he can't come back
to accompany me this weekend.

52
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:43,200
You'd better take
someone important, hear me?

53
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:46,350
I've been troubling you a lot lately.

54
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,670
I feel a bit bad,

55
00:03:47,690 --> 00:03:48,829
so I thought...

56
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,440
I'd give you these vouchers
as compensation.

57
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:53,290
It is a very popular restaurant.

58
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:54,740
Compensate me?

59
00:03:58,100 --> 00:03:59,150
But there are 2.

60
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:03,420
You can invite a friend.

61
00:04:06,410 --> 00:04:07,790
Invite a friend?

62
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,430
Who should I invite?

63
00:04:11,780 --> 00:04:13,940
Can't you think of any friends?

64
00:04:21,149 --> 00:04:23,390
If you don't want them, give them back.

65
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,870
You're taking back a gift?

66
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:29,230
Chaonan just broke off
Chuqing's engagement.

67
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:31,140
She must be pretty depressed.

68
00:04:37,990 --> 00:04:39,850
I'll ask her then.

69
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:45,860
And you said
you didn't know who to invite.

70
00:04:59,140 --> 00:05:00,640
You're unbelievable.

71
00:05:00,670 --> 00:05:03,070
You invite someone to dinner
and forget the vouchers.

72
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:05,320
Well, you owe me this meal.

73
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,660
Fine.

74
00:05:06,690 --> 00:05:08,230
Then I'll get going.

75
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:09,470
Where are you going?

76
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:11,870
Home.

77
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:14,070
Isn't Chuqing coming soon?

78
00:05:14,090 --> 00:05:15,570
I didn't invite her.

79
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,760
What do you mean?

80
00:05:18,790 --> 00:05:21,580
Then what about your other voucher?

81
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,450
Let's eat together.

82
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,670
You have nothing to do later, right?

83
00:05:25,670 --> 00:05:26,770
Let's go.

84
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,760
Come on.

85
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,070
[Celebrating the 2nd Anniversary]

86
00:05:35,409 --> 00:05:36,560
Good afternoon, you two.

87
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,170
Our restaurant is currently holding

88
00:05:38,170 --> 00:05:39,550
a second‑anniversary celebration—

89
00:05:39,550 --> 00:05:40,610
Perfect Pairs.

90
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,630
If you use these online
pre-ordered vouchers,

91
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:45,430
you can upgrade
to the couple's set meal directly.

92
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:46,880
We are not a couple.

93
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,520
We are just here to eat.

94
00:05:48,550 --> 00:05:50,740
Complimentary upgrade to this set meal,
better value than ordering à la carte.

95
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,020
Would you like to consider it?

96
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,580
Thank you, but it's okay.

97
00:05:53,610 --> 00:05:54,880
We don't need to upgrade.

98
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,280
Besides the great value of the meal,

99
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,620
after the meal, we will also give you this

100
00:05:57,620 --> 00:06:00,820
Heart‑Stealing Phantom Thief
co-branded merchandise.

101
00:06:06,650 --> 00:06:08,790
This is too awkward.

102
00:06:09,170 --> 00:06:10,430
Just for the free gift,

103
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:12,140
you are willing to sit here?

104
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:14,970
Don't you want the merchandise yourself?

105
00:06:14,990 --> 00:06:16,560
I just took a look.

106
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:19,130
Then give me your share too.

107
00:06:19,730 --> 00:06:20,680
No.

108
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:25,550
[Psychic Club]

109
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,300
The photos are all deleted.

110
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:30,360
The ones on the phone are deleted too.

111
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,600
I suddenly feel so relieved.

112
00:06:36,590 --> 00:06:39,080
Actually, I still want
to say sorry to you.

113
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,380
But thank you anyway.

114
00:06:44,790 --> 00:06:47,370
Actually, I think I should thank you too.

115
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:48,560
Thanks to you,

116
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:51,210
I realized that I really prefer

117
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:53,170
a more comfortable relationship.

118
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,000
You're welcome.

119
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:57,460
By the way,

120
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,640
since you don't have to marry me,

121
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:01,240
you don't have to die, right?

122
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:02,820
Die?

123
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:03,800
A fatal doom.

124
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:07,460
You mean a dead knot.

125
00:07:08,930 --> 00:07:11,640
Jiakai said it's untied.
There is no dead knot.

126
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:12,830
There's nothing to fear.

127
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:13,610
That's good.

128
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:16,360
Okay.

129
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:17,230
That's it then.

130
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:20,210
[Psychic Club]

131
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,350
Chaonan.

132
00:07:20,350 --> 00:07:21,680
Nice to meet you.

133
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,030
Nice to meet you too.

134
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,400
Bye-bye.

135
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:26,100
Bye-bye.

136
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,200
I should still get lucky in love, right?

137
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,480
Putting aside these garnishes,

138
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:45,240
this meal is really delicious.

139
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:48,360
I told you this restaurant
was hard to book.

140
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,180
I hope there will be a chance for me

141
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,210
to bring Grandma here to try it.

142
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,370
Grandma?

143
00:07:58,530 --> 00:08:01,660
Is she the family member
you often chat with on the phone?

144
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:05,150
Does she usually come
to Taipei to see you?

145
00:08:05,150 --> 00:08:06,220
No.

146
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,190
She is getting older.

147
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,680
She says it's troublesome to travel far.

148
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:12,720
She rarely comes to Taipei.

149
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:16,760
What about you?

150
00:08:16,790 --> 00:08:18,710
Do your parents come to see you?

151
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:20,000
I remember

152
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:22,740
you said before that
you would eat with your mom.

153
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:27,380
Occasionally.

154
00:08:28,620 --> 00:08:30,680
They actually don't come that often.

155
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:38,320
Why hasn't the dessert been served yet?

156
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,380
You haven't finished the rest.

157
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,809
Are you in a hurry?

158
00:08:43,309 --> 00:08:44,380
I'm not in a hurry.

159
00:08:44,810 --> 00:08:45,540
Are you?

160
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,970
No.

161
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,000
Then after you finish eating,

162
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,060
do you want to go for a walk somewhere?

163
00:08:58,930 --> 00:08:59,590
Jay Chou.

164
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:00,180
Where?

165
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:02,380
Damn it. Sneak attack.

166
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:05,160
Damn it.

167
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,160
[Qishi City Police Department
Qishi Branch]

168
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,200
[Qishi Police Station Jurisdiction Map]

169
00:09:42,330 --> 00:09:43,410
Good morning, Dawei.

170
00:09:43,410 --> 00:09:44,670
Good morning, Senior.

171
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:46,840
What's up?

172
00:09:46,870 --> 00:09:47,660
Nothing.

173
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,260
It's just almost time.

174
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,370
Time for what?

175
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,660
Time for Lin Jiakai
to enter the police station.

176
00:09:54,230 --> 00:09:55,440
I've noticed that

177
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:57,710
if you and Jiakai go to work together,

178
00:09:57,730 --> 00:09:59,460
within a minute of you coming in,

179
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:00,980
he will follow.

180
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,630
Is that so?

181
00:10:03,210 --> 00:10:05,250
You don't believe it? Want to bet?

182
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:07,620
It's just a coincidence. No need to bet.

183
00:10:08,330 --> 00:10:09,790
What were you guys talking about?

184
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:11,410
We were talking about

185
00:10:11,410 --> 00:10:13,620
whether Lin Jiakai would
walk in within the time limit.

186
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:15,210
How about it? Bet on lunch drinks.

187
00:10:15,210 --> 00:10:16,750
I'll bet. I bet he will.

188
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,840
Dawei.

189
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,390
Bet.

190
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:20,710
-Bet.
-Bet.

191
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:23,820
I bet he won't.

192
00:10:24,660 --> 00:10:26,150
Okay. How much time left?

193
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:27,680
Ten seconds left.

194
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:29,740
Seven, six,

195
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:34,730
-five, four, three, two, one.
-Four, three, two, one.

196
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:36,190
Welcome!

197
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:38,690
Chief.

198
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,020
Good morning.

199
00:10:40,050 --> 00:10:41,970
Today is not my birthday.

200
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,920
Is it necessary to welcome me like this?

201
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,390
Today is the day I lose drinks.

202
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:47,630
Senior's treat.

203
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:51,600
The word
I least want to hear today is "lose."

204
00:10:51,690 --> 00:10:53,540
I'm going to watch baseball tonight.

205
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,850
Don't jinx my brothers, okay?

206
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,220
Go, Chief.

207
00:10:58,390 --> 00:10:59,460
Thank you, Senior.

208
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:01,720
No, thank you, Chief.

209
00:11:01,750 --> 00:11:03,140
Lost.

210
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:08,350
Hey, where are you?

211
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:10,610
I'm at the door. Almost there.

212
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,050
What are you doing?

213
00:11:18,570 --> 00:11:20,390
I was walking halfway,

214
00:11:20,690 --> 00:11:22,690
and my shoe suddenly broke.

215
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:24,040
What's wrong?

216
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:26,380
Am I too late?

217
00:11:27,650 --> 00:11:28,460
No.

218
00:11:31,140 --> 00:11:32,410
It's just that we need to adjust

219
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:34,070
when and how we enter and exit.

220
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,010
Why?

221
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:38,390
Don't worry about it.

222
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:45,670
Where are you going?

223
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:48,930
I said don't ask so much.

224
00:11:49,550 --> 00:11:50,730
Stingy.

225
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:01,580
We're back.

226
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,160
Good job.

227
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:05,300
What is this?

228
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:07,820
Your boyfriend sent it.

229
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:10,000
He really sends you things often.

230
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:15,170
He actually managed to order this.

231
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:16,300
What is that?

232
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:17,960
Destiny Chocolate.

233
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:21,120
It picks 4 out of 8 different flavors.

234
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,150
If every single piece

235
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:23,750
suits your taste perfectly,

236
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,290
it's your Mr. Right.

237
00:12:25,950 --> 00:12:27,160
This is already sold out.

238
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,090
Didn't you know?

239
00:12:29,230 --> 00:12:30,610
I didn't know.

240
00:12:31,990 --> 00:12:32,950
Dawei.

241
00:12:33,540 --> 00:12:36,270
You can also give a gift
to someone important.

242
00:12:36,450 --> 00:12:38,980
Haven't you been
living together for a while?

243
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,690
What living together?

244
00:12:40,690 --> 00:12:42,140
I meant colleagues

245
00:12:42,170 --> 00:12:43,560
for a while.

246
00:12:43,940 --> 00:12:45,810
Why are you so sensitive?

247
00:12:47,820 --> 00:12:49,600
Sorry, I misheard.

248
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:55,730
[Destiny Chocolate] [Link the Time]

249
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,210
They really are advertising.

250
00:12:57,190 --> 00:12:58,320
Hello.

251
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:00,150
Why are you here?

252
00:13:00,290 --> 00:13:02,370
I should be asking you that.

253
00:13:04,130 --> 00:13:05,380
Chocolate.

254
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,680
[Destiny Chocolate] [Link the Time]

255
00:13:05,950 --> 00:13:06,950
You want this?

256
00:13:06,970 --> 00:13:08,480
You're the one who wants it.

257
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,630
It's not bad.

258
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,830
Do you have someone to give it to?

259
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:18,440
Yes.

260
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:23,000
There's someone in my department
who has liked me for a long time, okay?

261
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,460
I just didn't tell you.

262
00:13:26,210 --> 00:13:27,480
Stop lying,

263
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:29,110
Perverted College Student.

264
00:13:35,610 --> 00:13:36,610
Officer,

265
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:38,780
I'm talking about the warehouse ahead.

266
00:13:38,780 --> 00:13:39,910
Some bad guys

267
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:41,520
took some weapons

268
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:43,190
and rushed inside.

269
00:13:43,370 --> 00:13:45,570
I think they're going to collect a debt.

270
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:46,870
Mrs. Chen,

271
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:47,910
you called the police too?

272
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,330
I called them too.

273
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:51,540
They said a police officer
is already here.

274
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,940
A police officer is here?

275
00:13:55,130 --> 00:13:56,010
Freeze!

276
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:10,650
Freeze!

277
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:21,570
Assaulting officers!
You're assaulting officers!

278
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:32,540
Sorry.

279
00:14:38,850 --> 00:14:39,760
Are you okay?

280
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:40,710
Thanks.

281
00:14:42,130 --> 00:14:43,380
Go after them! Go!

282
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,120
Get down!

283
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:10,270
Didn't you hear me
tell you to get down? Stop moving!

284
00:15:10,270 --> 00:15:11,640
Jian, how is it now?

285
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:12,930
Zhiling.

286
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,300
Where's Dawei?

287
